{"name": "The Looking Glass Wars: House of Cards", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"496\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/c3f4184b6725cdb43a82d43d9059e735.poster.avif?t=1781556512\" width=\"882\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/c3f4184b6725cdb43a82d43d9059e735.webm?t=1781556512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/c3f4184b6725cdb43a82d43d9059e735.mp4?t=1781556512\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"168\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/e2a95373e5af5e88255f83b418907257.avif?t=1781556512\" width=\"1514\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a new kind of solitaire. Flip cards, build melds (short sets of runs or three-of-a-kind), and meet the quest\u2019s conditions. Spot patterns, build smart sequences, and adapt to the draw across 140+ handcrafted quests. Each puzzle introduces new constraints, tougher requirements, and fresh ways to test your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"496\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/b925665c0133e2ed76ff37f16f62fb96.poster.avif?t=1781556512\" width=\"882\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/b925665c0133e2ed76ff37f16f62fb96.webm?t=1781556512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/b925665c0133e2ed76ff37f16f62fb96.mp4?t=1781556512\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"168\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/85aaf52182cc09477f4fd55ca9c51989.avif?t=1781556512\" width=\"1514\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn Imagination Points by completing quests, then spend them to construct your House of Cards. Unlock new abilities, decide when your power cards appear, and shape the odds in your favor. You can\u2019t control the draw, but you can control the odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"496\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/38434a569c6df2c9896587e44647cfef.poster.avif?t=1781556512\" width=\"882\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/38434a569c6df2c9896587e44647cfef.webm?t=1781556512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/38434a569c6df2c9896587e44647cfef.mp4?t=1781556512\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"168\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/dde56fc07f56197d89dd481b7038e1b7.avif?t=1781556512\" width=\"1514\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter Frank Beddor\u2019s reimagined Wonderland, where Queen Alyss leads a war for Imagination. What appears as a familiar game quickly becomes a test of strategy, patience, and nerve. Do you have what it takes to join Alyss\u2019 army?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"496\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/5507262fac315dd53d328f30dcaa0d45.poster.avif?t=1781556512\" width=\"882\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/5507262fac315dd53d328f30dcaa0d45.webm?t=1781556512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/5507262fac315dd53d328f30dcaa0d45.mp4?t=1781556512\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"168\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/extras/44071286efee35ca92ff99ec24ebcd2c.avif?t=1781556512\" width=\"1514\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 140 quests to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15-20 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original art inspired by Frank Beddor\u2019s The Looking Glass Wars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock 17 Jacks to supercharge your play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Celebrate the 20th anniversary of The Looking Glass Wars</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "We built a solitaire game around a darker version of Alice in Wonderland that you won't put down. Draw cards, build runs and sets across 140+ handcrafted quests. It's the kind of game you play for one more quest at midnight.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4681630/66248dd62d2dfa36332ac5c259b9d9f70bc045e7/header.jpg?t=1781556512", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Solitaire", "Card Game", "Puzzle", "Mahjong", "PvE"], "developers": "Ep1t0me Studios", "publishers":